ures). That is 23.8% of revenue. In FY2020 it was $899 million.","cites":["KEYS.ocf.2025","KEYS.capex.2025","KEYS.revenue.2025","KEYS.ocf.2020","KEYS.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $162 million in FY2025, 3% of revenue, against 2.2% in FY2020.","cites":["KEYS.sbc.2025","KEYS.revenue.2025","KEYS.sbc.2020","KEYS.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $375 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["KEYS.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-07-31 revenue was $1.8 billion, up 36.5% from $1.4 billion in the three months ended 2025-07-31.","cites":["KEYS.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","KEYS.d.revenue.2025-05-01.2025-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $6.6 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $1.3 billion and net income to $1.3 billion.","cites":["KEYS.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","KEYS.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","KEYS.d.revenue.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","KEYS.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","KEYS.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","KEYS.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","KEYS.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","KEYS.d.opinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","KEYS.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","KEYS.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","KEYS.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","KEYS.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","KEYS.d.netinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","KEYS.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","KEYS.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.5 billion: operating cash flow of $1.6 billion less capital spending of $135 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["KEYS.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","KEYS.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","KEYS.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","KEYS.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-04-30","KEYS.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-07-31","KEYS.d.capex.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","KEYS.d.capex.2024-11-01.20